    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by the 'goblin' part? Didn't you mean to say something else about the signaling mechanism? Anyway, go on, you were saying about what happens if you're trying to build muscle without a surplus.",
      "source": "evaluator"
